* LAN hosts listed in virusprot / sshlockout / CrowdSec tables
* Transparent bridge support: passive ARP / NDP listening for MAC / IP tracking
* Collector status panel on the settings page

1.1

* LAN to LAN connections (incl. blocked attempts from the firewall log) with alerts
* LAN to LAN scan detection
* MAC / IP tracking: multiple IPs per MAC, IP changes, IP moved to another MAC
* Alerts tab with acknowledge

